  "description": "The titanium trail blazer, a bike built for life. Impervious to road salt, will take knocks and hits and just keep going on as if nothing happened. Don't be afraid to get rough, the frame can handle anything you throw at it. The RUUT Ti should be chosen by anyone who expects their bike to cover a vast range of applications and last a lifetime. What makes the RUUT exceptionally versatile is the unique TwinTip fork – a feature that allows you to fine tune the handling and set up your bike exactly the way you like – relaxed or racy, the choice is yours to make at any point in time. The Spank Wing 12 VIBROCORE handlebars feature a comfortable flat top filled with foam to absorb impact on uneven surfaces. New X-Wide HUNT gravel wheels with straight pull spokes and extra-wide 25mm internal rims ensure superior grip and better stability. The muddier, the better – this bike is ready for any adventure.",
